//  /  S7 — build-tier REAL-TOOL witness for the bounded review-chain
// composite forcing. Drives the BUILT neutrino-gen + neutrino-emit (not a mock)
// through the pressure-loop forcing harness on the committed flow and proves the
// derived register row AND the full derived evidence object match the committed
// artifacts. This is the non-vacuous real-tool integration the fast harness test
// cannot provide.
//
// Leaf concepts reduce to the closed requirement set through the AUTHORITATIVE L2
// bridge (domain-reduction), and the stage-permuted twin reduces identically:
// RUN: %neutrino-gen --target=capability-spec %S/Inputs/review_chain_leaf.neu -o %t.spec
// RUN: %neutrino-emit --kind=domain-reduction %S/Inputs/review_chain.l2.mlir --reduce-against %t.spec/capability-spec.json > %t.reda
// RUN: %neutrino-emit --kind=domain-reduction %S/Inputs/review_chain_permuted.l2.mlir --reduce-against %t.spec/capability-spec.json > %t.redb
// RUN: diff %t.reda %t.redb
// RUN: %FileCheck %s --check-prefix=L2RED < %t.reda
//
// A recursive stage->stage relation is refused by the reducer at its anchor:
// RUN: %not %neutrino-emit --kind=domain-semantics %S/Inputs/review_chain_recursive.l2.mlir 2>&1 | %FileCheck %s --check-prefix=RECURSE
//
// The source-level ordered variant is refused before dispatch, fabricating no coordination-plan:
// RUN: %not %neutrino-gen --target=coordination-plan %S/Inputs/review_chain_ordered.neu -o %t.ord 2>&1 | %FileCheck %s --check-prefix=ORDERED
// RUN: test ! -e %t.ord/coordination-plan.json
// RUN: %FileCheck %s --check-prefix=ORDDIAG < %t.ord/diagnostics.json
//
// The bounded stage posts on quorum-met but NO partial effect on an unmet quorum:
// RUN: %neutrino-gen --target=coordination-trace --scenario=%S/Inputs/review_chain_stage_miss.scn.json %S/Inputs/review_chain_stage.neu -o %t.miss
// RUN: %FileCheck %s --check-prefix=MISS < %t.miss/coordination-trace.json
//
// Drive the composite harness with the BUILT tools and match BOTH the committed
// register row and the committed evidence object byte-for-byte:
// RUN: python3 %scripts/generators/run_pressure_loop_forcing.py %examples/pressure-loop-forcing/s7-review-chain-fixtures.json --out %t.reg --evidence-dir %t.ev --neutrino-gen %neutrino-gen --neutrino-emit %neutrino-emit
// RUN: python3 %S/compare_s7_register.py %t.reg %examples/pressure-loop-register/s7-review-chain.json
// RUN: diff %t.ev/plf-s7-review-chain-overload.orchestration-overload.json %examples/pressure-loop-forcing/evidence/plf-s7-review-chain-overload.orchestration-overload.json
// RUN: %FileCheck %s --check-prefix=ROW < %t.reg
